  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Peacebuilding Opportunities Fund Phase Two (POF2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Second phase of the POF programme. The POF is a scalable, adaptable and contextually driven mechanism to pursue peacebuilding objectives in South Su-dan. Its intended impact is &#x201c;Enhanced South Sudanese capacity to manage conflicts without violence, and reduction in violence in targeted areas&#x201d;. Its outcomes are (i) &#x201c;targeted communities are more harmonious and resilient to conflict&#x201d;; and (ii) &#x201c;more inclusive political, socio-economic, and cultural institutions, which are key for handling conflict and establishing the conditions for sustained peace, are strengthened at all levels&#x201d;.</narrative>
  </description>
